  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that using scvi_n200 RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion achieves high accuracy (0.724989). The next experiment tests whether replacing the RNA encoder with pca_n2000 and the image encoder with resnet50 (while keeping aggregation and fusion the same) affects performance. This isolates the impact of encoder choices, which are critical design decisions, and helps determine if simpler encoders can match complex ones under the same aggregation/fusion strategy."
